Replacement contents for disc files: hle_extension::set_disc_file_source. A port
gives a source that is asked at every open of a disc file (path on the disc,
size, a reader of its own bytes); a filter it returns is what the game reads.
Used by the VC2 voice disc option (profiles/vc2/host/vc2_voice.cpp). (2026-11-24)

--- a/include/portablekit/hle_extension.hpp
